Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即是全 全即是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开启门扉的炼金术正是一场恶梦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,研究设施已经安排好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带各位前往古雷达本国
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚德拉斯中尉 拉路中士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是克莱顿博士一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保护他们安全抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是  - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,家呢? 不回家吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,家已经烧掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在要去新的家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总有一天他们会了解的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们要逃去古雷达吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们快滚吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家呢? 大家不一起去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 不要看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我作了一个有点可怕的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经很晚了 快上床睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 你还在看那本很难的书吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.05,0:02:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸跟妈妈的研究记录
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以说出去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 你看得懂炼金术吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然看得懂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后我也会教你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸妈正在研究很厉害的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是"强大的力量"对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不只是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有解开这个世界的真理的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个世界的真理?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要能找到那个方法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就能做出谁都没看过的新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前有这一页吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总觉得...好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天已经很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我出去看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚先待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 快逃!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,收获祭快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要吓我啦 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你久等了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去买三明治 结果还拿到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说这是派对也热闹过头了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快灭火! 动作快!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把伤患带走!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙是...怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看你急成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是想去哪啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那身囚犯服是穿来参加祭典的变装派对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 他是炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 别大意了 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,銮厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电击没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么招式?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快去追啊 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放弃无谓的抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 你不要这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂喂 你们知道我是谁吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是国家炼金术师大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钢铁的机械铠脚与右手...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本大爷就是钢之炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《钢之炼金术师剧场版》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《叹息之丘的圣星》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说是炼金术师? 在杂居房里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据说他是皎破手指的皮肤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用自己的血画出炼成阵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把监狱当成别墅住是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宪兵队已经封锁主要道路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是至今仍未发现他的踪迹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,霍克爱中尉 帮我准备车子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 马斯坦古上校
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么他们会在?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德华·爱力克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔冯斯·爱力克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这两位是目击者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然搞得这么夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梅尔宾·波贾 26岁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,4年半前因强盗伤害罪被判刑5年
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原本正在服刑中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,4年半前被判刑5年?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原本预定两个月后假释
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再撑一下就能重获自由的说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是沈不住气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么不把那种恐怖家伙关在独房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说完全没人知道他会用炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们吃完晚饭 正在听广播
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果他突然咬起了自己的手指
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他用血画炼成阵之前在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟平常一样在看报纸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算是在骚动中撕破的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,形状也未免太整齐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨天中央时报的晚报三版新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剪下了这张照片是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚·克莱顿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,偷渡到特普市的古雷达人被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特普市?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好像在哪里听过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,位于亚美斯多利斯西边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,与古雷达国境交界的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是瞎啊? 是气球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中尉 联络特普市的宪兵队
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 为什么他会乖乖坐牢至今
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凭他的力量 应该随时都能逃狱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且我从没看过那种炼成阵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是说这与神秘的炼金术有关?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来事情不太单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,前往特普市的特快车...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 火车要开了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 车票还没...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种东西等一下再说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们第一次去西边呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,究竟会遇到什么 等到了就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定有方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我们找回身体的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙是谁啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认识的梅尔宾不是长这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,9年前他说要去中央市工作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,离开家乡以后就音讯全无
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也没有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常适合用他来隐藏真实身分
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好惊人喔 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那边 那座山的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是特普市啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是奇特的城市呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,检查入境许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说要许可证耶 怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国界的城市还真麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们又不是要去古雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们为什么要来特普市?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我女儿他们生了小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那还真是恭喜了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动作很敏捷麻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连问都不问就动手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:12:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是古雷达的间言乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,检查许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用这个替代可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这...这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是国家炼金术师大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那小鬼竟是亚美斯多利斯的走狗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,检查许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不乖乖听话就开枪喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是碍事的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然是合成兽?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:13:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是来找你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,究竟有什么企图?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怪物在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧急停车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在刹车还太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 你去停下火车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,合成兽先生一个人旅行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,机械铠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是钢之炼金术师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,受欢迎的人还真辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有什么企图?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,碍事的人又变多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 还没好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我正在做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是锅炉 压力计 汽缸 刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在搞什么啊 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了 是黑蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧急状况 快停车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是敌人 是炼金术师!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:16:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们来救你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是陷阱!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然是陷阱?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是浪费我的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.87,0:17:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是辛苦你来迎接我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那种炼成阵是在哪学的?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不妙 是车站
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事情变得棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样下去会撞到车站的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刹车...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎样都好 快停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要撞上了!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧? 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那家伙 追吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,入侵的黑蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从特普市车站往南西移动中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又是他们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 那边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,疑似那名逃狱犯的男子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎朝你们那边过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家快逃!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 那些偷渡客在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被关在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,西...西边的圆顶建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,经过中央广场再往前走一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑蝙蝠正通过中央广场上空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的目的疑似西边的圆顶建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然这么乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:19:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把犯人放走了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是报纸上的那个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚·克莱顿?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是一伙的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住 逃狱的家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么又跟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 去追那女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以 不可以动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.57,0:22:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.40,0:23:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把那孩子还来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.11,0:23:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才想问你们真的那么想死吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.61,0:23:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先看清楚周围再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个山谷是我们的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 把那孩子还来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放心 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.25,0:23:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我捡一下我的头嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,空的?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.09,0:23:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妖...妖怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.39,0:24:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你侵踏了神的领域是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.98,0:24:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道是...把灵魂附着在盔甲上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.90,0:24:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟你在一起的那个炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是戴着机械铠对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.70,0:24:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,身体被拿去那边了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你会知道这种事?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的父母也是炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.75,0:24:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们一定也看过真理之门
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.17,0:24:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.55,0:24:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我父亲传授给我的炼成阵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我母亲的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫雅修雷·克莱顿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的是雅修雷哥哥吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.73,0:24:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.82,0:24:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直让你孤独一人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.78,0:24:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原谅哥哥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:24:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.83,0:25:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,究竟发生了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是钢之炼金术师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我听马斯坦古上校说了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.75,0:25:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是管理这座城市的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼得·索尤兹少校
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪条路可以到山谷下面去?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是想越过国界去古雷达吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.47,0:25:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说这个山谷是古雷达?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.64,0:25:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死亡峡谷不是一般人可以去的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.06,0:25:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个气球的四周就是这个山谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谷底有许多废弃物跟病菌
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.03,0:25:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且是罪犯的巢穴耶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才从天空降下的那些人呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.83,0:25:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,企图夺取特普市的恐怖组织
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们自称是"黑蝙蝠"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.58,0:25:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是你放的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,偷渡客要被移送到这里来的假消息
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.51,0:25:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差点就能把他们一网打尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:25:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逃狱的炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.59,0:26:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么会盯上那女孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那件事上校应该正在调查吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.27,0:26:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己就小心点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也要小心古雷达的秘密警察
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.94,0:26:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会代你向他们问好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.91,0:26:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 居然穿着盔甲  - 好大一个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 从亚美斯多利斯来的吗?  - 好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没事的  - 茱莉亚回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.91,0:26:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.54,0:26:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来她成功了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.33,0:26:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 茱莉亚  - 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.63,0:26:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你回来啦 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:33.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了 让大家担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.67,0:26:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 让大家担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.22,0:26:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.51,0:26:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.55,0:26:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还会去学校教我们吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.10,0:26:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再等我一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一定会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,波洛斯之山与米洛斯之丘
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:27:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自古就是米洛斯人的圣地啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.20,0:27:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.49,0:27:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 上校
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.00,0:27:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,温莉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.33,0:27:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很抱歉来打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里可不是平民能来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是来维修爱德的机械铠
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为他说右手会麻麻的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 爱德跟阿尔却都不在
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.97,0:27:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想说或许他们会在上校这里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.68,0:27:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为爱德没什么朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.06,0:27:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是那家伙的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.31,0:27:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且他可是活得好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.56,0:27:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么这么说...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.23,0:27:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.65,0:27:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,温莉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.94,0:27:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来打扰了 莉莎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.19,0:27:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了吗? 中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据说在特普市的车站
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.91,0:27:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有辆来自中央市的特急火车全毁
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.20,0:27:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德做了什么事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.12,0:27:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.71,0:27:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达透过正式管道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要求我方引渡罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.63,0:28:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,罪犯?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.63,0:28:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在特普市被逮捕的犯人当中
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据说有古雷达的通缉犯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚·克莱顿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.27,0:28:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,化岁的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在洞穴里的大本营啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.07,0:28:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 你明明想要救我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.99,0:28:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,倒是你能见到哥哥 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.87,0:28:33.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.58,0:28:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达为何要把这怪物带来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要这样 托尼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.09,0:28:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请原谅他的无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些人还不知道神的领域之事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.47,0:28:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 我已经习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个...阿尔先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.43,0:28:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔冯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.89,0:28:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔冯斯·爱力克
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.31,0:28:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱力克?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚美斯多利斯的爱力克兄弟?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:28:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来你知道我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.57,0:29:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,炼金术学多了 自然就会听说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.57,0:29:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.07,0:29:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔冯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.45,0:29:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们触犯了人体炼成的禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.41,0:29:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你想知道这种事?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父母曾经根据神话研究炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.59,0:29:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能开启门扉 理解真理之者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.43,0:29:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就能自由操控大地的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.51,0:29:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们告诉我这存在米洛斯神话中
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.69,0:29:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯的神话?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.73,0:29:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地底有一种名为岩浆的力量流动
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.03,0:29:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吸取这股能量 化为强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是米洛斯的神话
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.29,0:29:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若你们真的触犯人体炼成的禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.12,0:29:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定有看过真理之门对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.42,0:30:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只是想见死去的妈妈而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.60,0:30:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以的 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.65,0:30:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果触犯禁忌 一定会遭报应
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.78,0:30:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像我们这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.78,0:30:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了夺回我们的祖国
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,需要强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.41,0:30:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你告诉我 阿尔冯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会尽快让你出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.38,0:30:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再稍微忍耐一下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,味道真是有够臭的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:30:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.85,0:31:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然直接排到隔壁的国家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.94,0:31:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫米兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.78,0:31:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚把你的事告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.66,0:31:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到居然能活着见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.95,0:31:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的炼金术真的很惊人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.58,0:31:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑蝙蝠这个名字取得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很适合形容在两大国
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.71,0:31:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达与亚美斯多利斯之间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.25,0:31:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,四处徘徊游荡的你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.21,0:31:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚兰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.55,0:31:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.59,0:31:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是只能窝在这个洞穴中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.01,0:31:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才能存活下去的蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.55,0:31:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才需要更强的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们想借助你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.98,0:31:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及圣地的...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.10,0:31:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经问过他了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.69,0:31:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把那个人放了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.69,0:31:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.73,0:31:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟哥哥说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是为了想见死去的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.20,0:31:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才做了人体炼成
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来克莱顿博士是正确的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:31:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真理之门果然存在
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.46,0:32:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是他也因此失去了身体
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.09,0:32:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开启真理之门果然是很危险的事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 可以更接近强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然侵踏了神的领域
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.30,0:32:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.47,0:32:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我知道方法的话我也会去做的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.48,0:32:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了见爸爸跟妈妈...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.44,0:32:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.44,0:32:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看到他的样子了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.11,0:32:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算变成那样也无所谓吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想让米洛斯找回原有的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.57,0:32:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,助我一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.95,0:32:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你忘了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.78,0:32:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谷底那些人鄙视辱骂我们是叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.91,0:32:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一家人只好冒险搬去古雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.38,0:32:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那件事我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.46,0:32:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.71,0:32:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为何在接纳我们一家人的古雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.76,0:32:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸妈非得被杀死不可?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.48,0:33:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀死爸妈的是狼人合成兽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.40,0:33:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达军派来的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.65,0:33:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到场的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.70,0:33:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸妈早已经被狼人合成兽杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他大肆破坏研究室
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.33,0:33:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但又似乎在找什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.66,0:33:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在找的正是我手上的书
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸妈亲自撰写的研究书
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.55,0:33:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我抱着茱莉亚 死命逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.01,0:33:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 狼人合成兽凭着味道追来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认为可能逃不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.31,0:33:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,于是将茱莉亚藏在树洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接着前往山崖
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.94,0:33:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后 被古雷达军包围
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.27,0:33:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跌落谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇迹似地捡回一命的我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.66,0:33:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来偷渡到亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 他们仍死命追杀而来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.45,0:34:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我将爸爸的研究成果一一记熟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.87,0:34:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后故意犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.88,0:34:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要进入亚美斯多利斯巨大监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.55,0:34:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就能躲过他们的追杀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.47,0:34:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.64,0:34:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接着 当我正想着如何来救你时
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.06,0:34:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,理应在古雷达的你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.98,0:34:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知为何却偷渡到亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.85,0:34:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到居然是被谷底的人们利用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.53,0:34:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来我也被古雷达军抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.16,0:34:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,军方把我盘问了一番
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.45,0:34:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当他们发现我什么都不知道之后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.91,0:34:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只给我衣服穿 然后把我扔到谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.87,0:34:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我被谷底的人们救助
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才能存活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在因为我跟他们有相同理念
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.43,0:35:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才一起行动
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.34,0:35:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥小时候也在谷底跟他们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.81,0:35:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想想起以前的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.06,0:35:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们的目的也是圣地的炼金术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那只是过程之一罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.52,0:35:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的目的只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.28,0:35:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是让米洛斯独立
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.28,0:35:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们凭人数与力量是终究敌不过古雷达与亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.16,0:35:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只有两条路可选
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.46,0:35:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,触犯人体炼成的禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.37,0:35:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开后文真理之门
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.42,0:35:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是找回圣地的炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.92,0:35:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,选择其一 取得强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.55,0:35:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能去取得用来操控藏在地底的岩浆的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.51,0:35:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要王牌武器
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.98,0:35:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,博士究竟发现了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.31,0:35:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达也想知道这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.15,0:35:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们似乎有所企图
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.03,0:36:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.16,0:36:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有巨大盔甲掉下来这里啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.41,0:36:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.21,0:36:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶 叫我不要回去了是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.55,0:36:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.34,0:36:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 你在哪里啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.01,0:36:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望没有被当成废铁扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.07,0:36:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有人躲着对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.28,0:36:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带我去找你们的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.75,0:36:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逃狱犯掉进谷底?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.21,0:36:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.46,0:36:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟那个女孩一起掉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.88,0:36:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确定是茱莉亚·克莱顿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.13,0:37:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就照片来看是她没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是失态
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.97,0:37:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你认为古雷达那些人会相信吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.55,0:37:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.06,0:37:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钢仔在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.77,0:37:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他下去了古雷达的谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.52,0:37:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说是要去救弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.85,0:37:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.94,0:37:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.61,0:37:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德他们发生什么事了是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.87,0:37:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莎 特普市在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然有办法住在这种谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.55,0:37:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是刚才那个盔甲的同伙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.01,0:37:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚美斯多利斯的走狗吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.89,0:37:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是有很多原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一定会夺回圣地的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.39,0:37:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说的圣地是指特普市吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:38:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里叫米洛斯之丘
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.61,0:38:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,包含古雷达境内的波洛斯山
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.94,0:38:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一带从三千年以前
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.45,0:38:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是我们米洛斯人住的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.12,0:38:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么要离开那块圣地?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.04,0:38:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯被古雷达以武力并吞
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.58,0:38:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来接近我们 说要提供援助的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.50,0:38:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是你们亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.30,0:38:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当我们让你们的军队进来后
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.93,0:38:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,山谷化为战场
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.80,0:38:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,神圣之丘也被你们夺走了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.52,0:38:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的父母也在那时候被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.65,0:38:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真不应该问这些的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.25,0:38:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多加一些颜色啦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.29,0:38:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用铁跟玻璃...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.00,0:39:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佩德罗 茱莉亚真的回来了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.79,0:39:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.84,0:39:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才下面不是有一阵骚动吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.67,0:39:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.38,0:39:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.22,0:39:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.01,0:39:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个老伯是怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫冈札雷斯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.68,0:39:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是从哪来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.56,0:39:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这只手臂是谁做的?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.89,0:39:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我的儿时玩伴做的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.02,0:39:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 老伯!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.07,0:39:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.66,0:39:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老伯 原来你是做机械铠的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.21,0:39:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冈伯 我的只做到一半
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.21,0:39:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕 糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.55,0:39:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要把神经接起来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好好压着
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.22,0:39:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了吗? 要开始罗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.43,0:39:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一二
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.85,0:39:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老伯 你也太粗暴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.93,0:40:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还在复健就搞坏这么多次
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样下去你会站不起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.65,0:40:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等做好之后再付钱就好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.31,0:40:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真抱歉 冈伯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.86,0:40:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,话说回来 还真多人受伤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.48,0:40:10.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为常发生崩塌意外
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.74,0:40:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,崩塌?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达正在前面兴建地热工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.74,0:40:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他伙伴只领到微薄的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.49,0:40:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被当成奴隶般使唤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.21,0:40:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里面有座火山
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.25,0:40:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是用那里的热能
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.75,0:40:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后 这边是亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.38,0:40:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以在谷底变成夹心饼是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.51,0:40:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个叫茱莉亚的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.93,0:40:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爬到那么高的地方去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.85,0:40:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是战士
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.60,0:40:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会畏惧跌落山崖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.64,0:40:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是秘密警察
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.77,0:40:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.65,0:40:44.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佩德罗 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.98,0:40:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老伯 保重了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.69,0:40:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要好好珍惜你的机械铠
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是洞穴的公寓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.60,0:41:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.94,0:41:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有味道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.15,0:41:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.28,0:41:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人爬上山崖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被亚美斯多利斯击落了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.82,0:41:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要稍微爬上山崖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.74,0:41:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就会被视为跨越国界
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.74,0:41:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后就任凭他们处置了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.71,0:41:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.51,0:41:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.01,0:41:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.13,0:41:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 佩德罗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.30,0:42:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,荣耀都归于米洛斯...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.44,0:42:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有在看书啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.36,0:42:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次潜入亚美斯多利斯或古雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.23,0:42:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都会收集一些书回来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.19,0:42:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.53,0:42:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是只学会用一点炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.74,0:42:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚是像妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.62,0:42:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说来 哥哥你比较像爸爸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.87,0:42:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.92,0:42:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伤痕...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.33,0:42:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们对你还真狠毒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.84,0:42:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把双手伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.02,0:42:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.08,0:43:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.08,0:43:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是其他伙伴教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.21,0:43:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然我还不太会用爸妈的炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.13,0:43:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但唯有这个我有学会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.13,0:43:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真抱歉 让你受苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 你还记得这个吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.14,0:43:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是哥哥帮我做的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.35,0:44:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.16,0:44:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.82,0:44:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有这个 哥哥就戴那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.41,0:44:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥你怎么这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.42,0:44:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本来想跟你戴一样的说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.38,0:44:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像发生过那种事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.17,0:44:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.67,0:44:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能再见到哥哥 真的很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.43,0:44:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 等夺回圣地之后
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.39,0:44:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再像以前那样在这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.85,0:44:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.68,0:44:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是怪物!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.07,0:44:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.08,0:45:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.21,0:45:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是缠人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.21,0:45:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你居然杀了佩德罗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.42,0:45:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.30,0:45:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逃狱的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.67,0:45:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.67,0:45:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 原来你没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.55,0:45:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然主动现身
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.52,0:45:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.40,0:45:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你肯乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就不会把其他人也卷进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.58,0:45:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.41,0:45:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.37,0:45:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在西边的大洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.25,0:45:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,派出下一个合成兽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.88,0:45:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.43,0:46:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.10,0:46:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们并不是什么伙伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.03,0:46:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.32,0:46:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔先生
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.95,0:46:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫我阿尔就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.35,0:46:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙是什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.94,0:47:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是狼人合成兽?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.90,0:47:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.23,0:47:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟杀死我父母的凶手是一伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他刚才说是凭着味道追来的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.49,0:47:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要你还在
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.82,0:47:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们还会再打来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.91,0:47:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要找这男人帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.33,0:47:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.62,0:47:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我随时都可以离开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.79,0:47:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 要跟茱莉亚一起
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.63,0:47:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.34,0:47:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要跟大家留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.21,0:47:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟着这些人又能做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.59,0:47:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是能不能做
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.51,0:47:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是非去做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.68,0:47:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.22,0:47:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果真理之门不行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.39,0:47:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就只好去取得圣地的炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.35,0:47:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有那个 我们一定能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.82,0:47:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要得到圣地的...鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.40,0:47:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鲜血之星?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是怪物!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.87,0:47:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又新来了两个 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.87,0:47:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看 我不是说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.20,0:47:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家 往里面走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.96,0:48:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没路了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.92,0:48:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跳过去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,味道消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.56,0:48:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被他们逃掉了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.98,0:48:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎是利用地下水脉阻绝了味道
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.81,0:48:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,倒是那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.23,0:48:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是何时学会克莱顿夫妻的炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.40,0:48:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要杀那男人还真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.86,0:48:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,挖掘作业已经完成
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.12,0:48:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 进行下一个工程
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.99,0:48:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.70,0:48:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好惊人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.16,0:48:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到地底居然有这种湖
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.58,0:48:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又被你救了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.67,0:48:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不知道该怎么谢你好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.63,0:48:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.13,0:48:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是为了自己的事才来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找回身体
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.59,0:48:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为此 至今我们调查许多炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.93,0:49:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找回身体?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.93,0:49:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种事要怎么办到?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.06,0:49:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.69,0:49:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 被我们自己失去的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.94,0:49:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要靠自己的力量找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.61,0:49:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我跟哥哥一起决定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.61,0:49:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.03,0:49:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 还真让我羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想法居然能跟哥哥如此一致
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.08,0:49:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.87,0:49:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 不要扔下我啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.25,0:49:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真拿他没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.42,0:49:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为戴机械铠不方便游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.30,0:49:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.80,0:49:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我先过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.55,0:49:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.30,0:49:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟哥哥一起决定的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.14,0:49:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里面也是你们的大本营吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.35,0:49:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 这里面有个大空间
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.98,0:49:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.61,0:49:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.49,0:49:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前这里是个
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.90,0:49:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有成千上万米洛斯人居住的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.20,0:50:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是米洛斯人的城市?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.58,0:50:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是四百年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达人将我们的祖先赶下谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.50,0:50:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了得到长生不老的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.84,0:50:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长生不老的石头?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那该不会是红色的石头?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.51,0:50:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.97,0:50:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们称它为贤者之石
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.89,0:50:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,贤者之石
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.22,0:50:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告诉我更详细一点 来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要再次谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.19,0:50:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们救了茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.44,0:50:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德华 阿尔冯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.74,0:50:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.90,0:50:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们大本营的最内部
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.70,0:50:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,镇魂之间
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.12,0:50:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,镇魂?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.70,0:50:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,祭祀过去挖山谷的米洛斯人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及战死米洛斯人的灵魂之处
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.00,0:50:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,挖山谷? 什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.75,0:50:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣地周围原本并没有现在这么深的山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.89,0:51:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们祖先将祭拜波洛斯神山的山丘视为圣地 建立了国家
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.31,0:51:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据说山丘周围埋有长生不老之石
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.48,0:51:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们称那些石头为鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.95,0:51:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 当古雷达人知道这项传说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.41,0:51:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,派遣大军来攻打这里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.53,0:51:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们抢夺我们的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了寻找鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.25,0:51:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在圣地周围挖掘了三百年
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.87,0:51:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果挖出如此巨大的山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.04,0:51:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们米洛斯人被夺走家园
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.84,0:51:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像奴隶般地被使役
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.47,0:51:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这期间完全不知挖出多少鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.72,0:51:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当古雷达人离开时
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.52,0:51:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只留给米洛斯人深谷与废墟
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.31,0:51:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来他们继续从山崖上统治我们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.07,0:51:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚美斯多利斯攻打来时
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.70,0:52:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达人把我们米洛斯人派到最前线作战
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.95,0:52:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刻印在这里的就是当时死去的米洛斯人的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战争结束后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.96,0:52:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们又被赶到谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.92,0:52:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,充当国界的护盾
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.13,0:52:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被挖出来的鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并没有文献记载被送去古雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.22,0:52:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过去被挖出来的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.31,0:52:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定还沈眠于圣地某处
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.81,0:52:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是圣地的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.65,0:52:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这块石碑就是炼金术师们为了挖鲜血之星而做的设计图
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.94,0:52:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,使用炼金术的那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.49,0:52:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等于间接使米洛斯人被赶到谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.45,0:52:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对谷底的人们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.20,0:52:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,炼金术会让他们想起痛苦的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.54,0:52:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 研究炼金术的我的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.83,0:52:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也遭到大家排斥厌恶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.50,0:53:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 逃避过去是无法前进的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.51,0:53:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若要掌握未来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.18,0:53:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,必须靠自己的力量从谷底爬上去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.93,0:53:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为此我们需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.18,0:53:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,炼金术的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.52,0:53:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及 强大的大地力量
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.23,0:53:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 你先听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.73,0:53:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果鲜血之星跟亚美斯多利斯的贤者之石是相同东西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.86,0:53:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它的原材料是...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.53,0:53:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,活人的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.49,0:53:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人的生命?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.70,0:53:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.87,0:53:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长生不老根本是骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.12,0:53:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是用有限的生命集合起来炼成的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.09,0:53:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那根本不是贤者之石
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.13,0:53:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是从欲望中诞生的血淋淋石头
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.88,0:53:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是圣地的...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.76,0:53:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我父母才一直对古雷达的军人隐瞒这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.85,0:53:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为米洛斯神话也是用血换来的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.14,0:53:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.19,0:54:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.65,0:54:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种东西怎么能拿来用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.07,0:54:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们至今究竟是为了什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.71,0:54:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴塔涅
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.38,0:54:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.30,0:54:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里的大家都愿意为国捐躯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.39,0:54:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果鲜血之星真是人命做的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.72,0:54:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就把那些性命
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.10,0:54:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿来用在我们的未来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.23,0:54:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.98,0:54:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们真的要那样做吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.44,0:54:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.19,0:54:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴看到你回来谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.45,0:54:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你居然有脸说那种话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.03,0:54:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.74,0:54:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们过去曾侮辱你们一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.45,0:54:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,必须向你们道歉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.29,0:54:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接着 我想拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.29,0:55:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.17,0:55:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你愿意跟茱莉亚一起帮我们吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.30,0:55:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你难道不知道你们正打算让多少无谓的性命白白牺性吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.26,0:55:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的确付出了许多牺性
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.89,0:55:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 那些血绝对不是白流的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.43,0:55:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.85,0:55:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人们会为了某些东西而不惜牺性性命去换取
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.61,0:55:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.49,0:55:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,牺性人命来换取梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.74,0:55:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们这样真的能得到幸福吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.78,0:55:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种事我们也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.33,0:55:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我们没其它选择了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.67,0:55:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.92,0:55:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们居住的国家势力很强
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.25,0:55:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以不用担心会被消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不用害怕哪天会被杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.30,0:55:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我们不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.26,0:55:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们被抢夺炼金术力量的强大邻国持续威胁至今
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.18,0:56:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夺回圣地 得到长生不老的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.10,0:56:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也等于是让这段历史划上休止符
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.94,0:56:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常感谢你们的忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.82,0:56:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.53,0:56:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我们无法认同你们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望你们记住这点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.03,0:56:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.04,0:56:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.88,0:56:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.92,0:56:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不可能知道星星在哪里的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.84,0:56:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.22,0:56:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的梦想 我来帮你实现
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等夺回圣地之后
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.56,0:56:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再一起回谷底生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.27,0:56:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.11,0:56:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么圣地啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.44,0:56:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说穿了就是在互抢贤者之石嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.03,0:56:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 那块土地原本是他们的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.12,0:56:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然说要用自己的性命去交换?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.37,0:57:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种想法只会自取灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.58,0:57:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之 得来亲眼瞧瞧他们所说的炼金术到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.71,0:57:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.63,0:57:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老伯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.63,0:57:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不介意的话 能帮他献个花吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.77,0:57:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说是被古雷达的怪物杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.10,0:57:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幸好大伙能一起送他最后一程
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.27,0:57:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明明在他身边...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.40,0:57:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.16,0:57:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不是亚美斯多利斯人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.62,0:57:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 为什么你们会在这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.70,0:57:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.37,0:57:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闭嘴! 这两人不一样!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.71,0:57:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉了 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.59,0:57:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些是今天死去的人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.26,0:57:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,迪亚在捡垃圾时受了伤
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.22,0:57:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安妮塔生了小孩后
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.93,0:58:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟刚出生的婴儿一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.18,0:58:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,路西奥则是手放在国界的山崖
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,遭到射杀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.48,0:58:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么这样...大家明明还很年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.44,0:58:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是这个谷底的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.53,0:58:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佩德罗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.15,0:58:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你本来是想帮助大家
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.90,0:58:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而奋战到今天的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.67,0:58:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冈伯
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.63,0:58:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.88,0:58:33.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个 请帮我交给茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.30,0:58:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我跟迪亚一起做的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.22,0:58:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是护身符
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.59,0:58:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.97,0:58:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 我会交给她的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.35,0:58:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.82,0:58:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.53,0:58:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,山谷已经一片黑暗了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.86,0:58:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来米洛斯的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.41,0:59:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直从那个黑暗谷底望着天空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.08,0:59:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样下去 山谷又会被血染红
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.58,0:59:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,炼金术不是万能的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.67,0:59:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以仰赖什么强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.05,0:59:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.47,0:59:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,实在搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.97,0:59:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.60,0:59:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梅尔宾·波贾的冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.52,0:59:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,遭到某人的追杀
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.85,0:59:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对方大概是古雷达的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.27,0:59:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为过累了逃亡生活
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.52,0:59:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,于是躲进了监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.07,0:59:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 为什么是5年?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.45,0:59:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要使出炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.28,0:59:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他明明随时都能逃狱的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.32,0:59:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您是说若只为了隐匿行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.58,0:59:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有必要等5年是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.91,0:59:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.91,0:59:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,5年其实很长呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.25,0:59:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟爱德 阿尔在5年前
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.96,0:59:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都还是个什么都不懂的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.51,0:59:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.17,1:00:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,消逝的时间已经无法挽回了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.34,1:00:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.26,1:00:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从现在这个瞬间起算的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.06,1:00:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是任凭自己去掌握
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.56,1:00:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.81,1:00:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果那两人先到就不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.53,1:00:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个小鬼岂会知道圣地的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.57,1:00:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达想要的是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.87,1:00:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,家父在临终前夕
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.58,1:00:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把自己的皮肤撕下 交给了我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.41,1:00:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,通往鲜血之星的道路 就在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.92,1:00:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 修成这样应该就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.97,1:00:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我这边也好了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.35,1:00:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先去探查一下整座城市的情况吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.60,1:00:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有什么线索吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.27,1:00:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有 有件事让我很在意
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.31,1:00:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钢兄弟回到特普市了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.32,1:01:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然不是回去中央 而是来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.03,1:01:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是在谷底有找到什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.08,1:01:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在地底的大本营不是有设计图吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.33,1:01:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还记得特普市有很多座高塔吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.71,1:01:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的确有
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.75,1:01:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不觉得奇怪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.34,1:01:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果只是要挖山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么要正确地重现高塔的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.88,1:01:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说来...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.30,1:01:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且没有其它建筑 只有高塔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.02,1:01:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做那张设计图的人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.23,1:01:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是根据某法则在找贤者之石
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.86,1:01:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 那个法则跟高塔有关是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.82,1:01:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然没有确切证据
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.15,1:01:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你先看一下这个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.86,1:01:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是大本营设计图中的高塔位置
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.37,1:01:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这则是实际的高塔位置
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.00,1:01:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.91,1:01:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以这条轴线为界的南边
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.12,1:01:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高塔变少了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.71,1:02:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前存在的高塔被人破坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.75,1:02:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被破坏的高塔有什么含意吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.67,1:02:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 将高塔的数量减少
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.93,1:02:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是为了集中某种力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.10,1:02:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,集中在南边剩下的这一点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.10,1:02:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的目标是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.56,1:02:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,诱饵部队先朝对岸的亚美斯多利斯军驻扎地发动攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.78,1:02:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吸引他们的注意
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.15,1:02:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是城市之鼠 准备完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.57,1:02:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随时都可行动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.86,1:02:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.28,1:02:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们将鲜血之星当成目标
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.99,1:02:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的是对的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.08,1:02:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要那个力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.29,1:02:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.71,1:02:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这条路是你指引我们的不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.09,1:02:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.26,1:02:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拥有操控星星的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.47,1:02:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你能以此为傲
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.26,1:02:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个嘛...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.35,1:02:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.64,1:02:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冈伯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么跑到这么危险的地方来?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.44,1:03:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,路西奥跟迪亚...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.53,1:03:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.12,1:03:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡丽娜要我拿来给你的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.41,1:03:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说是迪亚跟卡丽娜一起做的护身符
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.62,1:03:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是希望你带在身上
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.92,1:03:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.14,1:03:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.30,1:03:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我根本没时间犹豫了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.26,1:03:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了保护那些孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.02,1:03:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我必须找到星星才行
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.32,1:03:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要太勉强喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.40,1:03:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 这里是...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.57,1:03:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到居然会回到这里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.00,1:03:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像只是一间教会
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.83,1:04:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.25,1:04:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是风
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.01,1:04:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.76,1:04:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯时代的高塔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.51,1:04:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被古雷达的建筑物包围住
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.10,1:04:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.31,1:04:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是通往其它世界的入□是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.53,1:04:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.86,1:04:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯时代的城市
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.78,1:04:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么会在这种地底?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.36,1:04:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是古雷达干的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.82,1:04:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过去米洛斯人在此炼成鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.08,1:04:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道此事的古雷达
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.58,1:04:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夺下这个特普市
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.33,1:04:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将整个城市封印起来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.29,1:04:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想独占神话的秘密是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.67,1:04:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 他们还没解开谜题
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.84,1:04:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就被企图扩大疆土的亚美斯多利斯夺走了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.10,1:04:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.60,1:04:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.10,1:05:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎也有人察觉到这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.10,1:05:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上面的教会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.56,1:05:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是用来隐藏地底入□的伪装
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.78,1:05:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,前面就是圣地的秘密是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.84,1:05:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞什么啊 什么都没有麻
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.63,1:05:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然故弄玄虚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.59,1:05:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 这个房间应该是为了某些特别的事而打造的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.01,1:05:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.39,1:05:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特别的事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.27,1:05:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是棺材吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.77,1:05:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.57,1:05:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一二
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.03,1:06:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么麻 居然是空的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.66,1:06:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.46,1:06:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.58,1:06:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本来还以为你们能多少帮忙解开一些这个房间的谜题呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.46,1:06:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,索尤兹
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个棺材是我为了抓没用处的炼金术师而叫人做的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.39,1:06:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来在找贤者之石的人是你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.47,1:06:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已查到这房间似乎有什么玄机
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.77,1:06:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剩下只好指望米洛斯那些苍蝇了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.90,1:06:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你哪有办法操控贤者之石!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.49,1:06:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不必担心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.65,1:06:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,世界上想要贤者之石的人多的是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.53,1:06:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,价格可是随便我开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.99,1:06:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少校 不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.66,1:06:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.91,1:06:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚美斯多利斯本土的国界基地周围
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.96,1:06:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生了爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.17,1:06:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是米兰达他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.54,1:06:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是心急的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就来瞧瞧他们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.51,1:06:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.05,1:06:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.01,1:07:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早知道应该带一个师团来的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.85,1:07:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谷底的那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.10,1:07:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到主动跑来自取灭亡
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.53,1:07:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈薛中校 已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.53,1:07:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人尽快撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.82,1:07:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重复一次 所有人...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.07,1:07:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在对岸的火灾现场上空
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.87,1:07:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发现多数恐怖份子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.58,1:07:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.66,1:07:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这只是诱饵 坚守岗位
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.29,1:07:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.10,1:07:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时间差不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.39,1:07:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托你了 米兰达
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.85,1:07:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只差一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.15,1:07:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那些苍蝇抵达之前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.57,1:07:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先送你们上路吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.36,1:07:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以问个问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.24,1:08:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.15,1:08:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这个特普市
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.03,1:08:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其它地方还有很多这种地下室吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.41,1:08:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.08,1:08:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你们能解开这座城市的谜题
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.42,1:08:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就能全部让你们看了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.00,1:08:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.38,1:08:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那还真是遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.76,1:08:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.64,1:08:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算不用那么客气来打招呼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.01,1:08:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也早就做好欢迎的准备了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.77,1:08:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有在听吗? 索尤兹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.60,1:08:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在就要去修理你了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.44,1:08:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在搞什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.90,1:08:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快把他们杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.48,1:08:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要让他们跟那些苍蝇接触
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.69,1:08:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少校
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.07,1:08:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第4监视所好像遭人袭击
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.70,1:08:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.70,1:08:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑蝙蝠的目标是地底的教会
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.45,1:08:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在他们抵达之前
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.79,1:08:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住那些炼金术师!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.88,1:08:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,秘密的房间不只这里有而已
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.38,1:08:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算一个个找出来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.63,1:09:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也解不了谜题的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.05,1:09:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.14,1:09:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不去地底吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.81,1:09:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.56,1:09:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.14,1:09:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这座城市不太妙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.94,1:09:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.15,1:09:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.65,1:09:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了骗你们上当
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.78,1:09:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 这个城市被设下陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.66,1:09:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以出手!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.32,1:09:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们快逃离这个城市
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.33,1:09:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要为了未来而前进
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.79,1:09:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.12,1:09:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们的忠告
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.00,1:09:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果会有报应 我一个人扛起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.67,1:09:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.38,1:09:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧 阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.64,1:09:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等我们突破东方的监视所
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.22,1:09:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,潜入的老鼠们就一起点燃烟火
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.23,1:09:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会在市区以极低空飞行移动
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.27,1:10:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后利用火灾的热能一□气上升
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.40,1:10:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逼近中央监视塔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.24,1:10:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.36,1:10:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么他们不去地底?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.86,1:10:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第2警戒网遭到突破
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朝着这座监视塔而来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.62,1:10:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地面部队在搞什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.50,1:10:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被他们潜伏的同伙扰乱
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.46,1:10:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无法动弹
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.21,1:10:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是想先麻痹我军再钻进地底吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.00,1:10:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是狂妄
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.21,1:10:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少校 请尽快避难
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.38,1:10:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果楼梯被压制 就无处可逃了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.64,1:10:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们想攻击那座塔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.47,1:10:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,意思是那里有鲜血之星吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.85,1:10:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.77,1:10:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.57,1:10:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少校 请往上走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.66,1:10:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙还真夸张
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.99,1:10:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别管他 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.17,1:11:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷 就是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.92,1:11:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,通往星星的路在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.42,1:11:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.48,1:11:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来看一下这个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.81,1:11:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.56,1:11:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传达命令的传声筒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.11,1:11:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个圣地有许多根这种管线
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.61,1:11:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在虽然是用来当传声筒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.28,1:11:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但以前还有另一种用途
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.74,1:11:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另一种用途?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.74,1:11:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 那就是圣地的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.79,1:11:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.09,1:11:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.25,1:11:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.26,1:11:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚兰
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.22,1:11:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.35,1:11:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,必须这么做才行
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.35,1:12:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.98,1:12:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听好了 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.81,1:12:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这根传声筒以网状方式被铺设在圣地各处
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.24,1:12:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果把活人的血灌进去会怎样?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.42,1:12:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.42,1:12:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.54,1:12:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个世界没有所谓的白流的血
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.67,1:12:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是用活人的血画出的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.05,1:12:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,立体炼成阵
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.34,1:12:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.22,1:12:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚德拉斯中尉
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.85,1:12:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,5年实在有点长呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.10,1:12:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,辛苦了 拉路中士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.73,1:12:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你在这座山谷看守茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.19,1:12:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.73,1:12:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他曾经是古雷达的军人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.24,1:12:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对吧 中士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.78,1:12:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切都是为了星星
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.03,1:12:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不输给古雷达或亚美斯多利斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.32,1:12:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于能建立我们的国家了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.87,1:12:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚德拉斯中尉
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.04,1:12:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.87,1:13:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚兰
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.67,1:13:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你表现得很好 拉路中士
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.50,1:13:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中尉...这是为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.01,1:13:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要完成这个炼成阵 血还不够呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.44,1:13:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 你还记得我吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.48,1:13:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自从我偷听到你父母的谈话后
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.61,1:13:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就一直等着这天的到来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.08,1:13:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了? 没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.96,1:13:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从我奉命保护从谷底逃上来的那个肮脏学者一家人的时候开始
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.26,1:13:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚德拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.39,1:14:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚德拉斯护卫长
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.93,1:14:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来你欺骗了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.06,1:14:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我绝不饶你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.32,1:14:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还记得我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.57,1:14:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想说能试一下炼金术的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.99,1:14:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才加入古雷达军
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.74,1:14:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到都是小争斗 让我很厌烦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.16,1:14:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是在那时候遇见你们一家人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.75,1:14:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你父亲是个很厉害的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.92,1:14:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然把研究成果烙印在两个孩子身上
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.80,1:14:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但那时候你还很年幼
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.51,1:14:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要跟雅修雷的地图重叠还太小了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.64,1:14:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这5年我可是等了好久啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.10,1:14:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把哥哥怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.93,1:14:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剥了他的皮 把地图放到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.52,1:14:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你杀了...哥哥?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.49,1:14:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在问这个又有什么用?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.11,1:15:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥...哥哥...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.83,1:15:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你竟然...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.16,1:15:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我仔细瞧瞧你的地图吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.29,1:15:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,生气! 更生气一点!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.17,1:15:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.51,1:15:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来真正的地图就完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是爸妈留下来的秘密?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是显示接下来将被炼成的鲜血之星所在处的地图
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.76,1:15:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经没用处了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.55,1:16:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就跟他们一样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.26,1:16:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把血注入炼成阵吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.35,1:16:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.73,1:16:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.65,1:16:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是碍事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.57,1:16:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.03,1:16:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要...活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.40,1:16:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.66,1:16:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是一群爱给人添麻烦的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.26,1:16:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这混帐 这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.51,1:16:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这混帐...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.77,1:16:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉晚来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.06,1:16:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.10,1:16:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本来以为你是超厉害的炼金术师
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.44,1:16:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到居然是个小偷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.86,1:16:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若被没大脑的人拿去用
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.44,1:16:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对星星来说才更倒楣呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.11,1:17:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星星已经炼成了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.99,1:17:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.75,1:17:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有滑翔翼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.67,1:17:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要紧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.46,1:17:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,交给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.18,1:18:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星星诞生了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.85,1:18:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩埋这个邪恶山谷的时刻到了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.06,1:18:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新的世界即将揭幕
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.32,1:18:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古拉滋 引爆坑道
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.78,1:18:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 已经准备完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.08,1:18:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.21,1:18:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么? 发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.88,1:18:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是瞎啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.22,1:18:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.73,1:19:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.91,1:19:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不在我们的计划中
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.87,1:19:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶 该如何是好?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.91,1:19:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.21,1:19:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要用那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.41,1:19:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以那么做
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.62,1:19:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个男人也在打星星的主意
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.75,1:19:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.09,1:19:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥跟茱莉亚去追他
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.76,1:19:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来挡下熔岩
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.72,1:19:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.88,1:19:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要紧的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.59,1:19:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麻烦你守护山谷了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.43,1:19:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,交给我吧 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.06,1:19:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.69,1:19:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.69,1:19:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.26,1:20:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是...鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.97,1:20:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来世界就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.97,1:20:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别想得逞!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.23,1:20:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于得到了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.32,1:20:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.74,1:20:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.54,1:20:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一群死小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.00,1:20:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星星在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.84,1:20:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别小看我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.31,1:20:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雕虫小技
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.02,1:21:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后一击!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.36,1:21:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好恐怖
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.78,1:21:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老是用这招
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.41,1:21:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.45,1:21:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是...鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.17,1:21:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个星星是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.21,1:21:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.22,1:21:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带着它逃到上面
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.38,1:21:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后丢进熔岩里 快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.55,1:21:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有这个...就能拯救山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.98,1:21:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有这个...大家就...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.98,1:21:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.36,1:21:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.74,1:21:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的心会被星星腐蚀的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.53,1:21:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.20,1:21:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.08,1:22:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 听得见吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.75,1:22:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把我的星星还来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.13,1:22:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把星星还给我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.39,1:22:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.39,1:22:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.27,1:22:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸...妈妈...哥哥...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.11,1:22:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你杀了...大家
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.04,1:22:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.00,1:22:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经够了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.00,1:22:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是因为有这种地方...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.46,1:22:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果没有这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.38,1:22:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家就不会互相争夺...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.17,1:22:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不会死了!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.43,1:23:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时候到了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.93,1:23:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中校
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.68,1:23:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来由我自己来收拾局面
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.36,1:23:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要撑下去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.49,1:23:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果再后退 就会流到村子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.92,1:23:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,撤退! 撤退!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.54,1:23:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.84,1:23:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,索尤兹在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.80,1:23:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是恐怖份子吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.67,1:23:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校 这女孩不是敌人!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.13,1:23:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钢仔
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.09,1:23:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德华
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.34,1:23:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.14,1:23:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钢仔 这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.18,1:23:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以帮我个忙吗? 上校
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.35,1:23:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.85,1:23:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特普市已经完成任务了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.98,1:23:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任务?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.27,1:23:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是用来制造贤者之石的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.98,1:23:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.32,1:23:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逃狱那家伙为了炼成石头
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.11,1:24:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑来了这里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.20,1:24:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果被他知道就糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.78,1:24:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就当成上校他们被黑蝙蝠暗杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.37,1:24:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个混帐
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.63,1:24:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把那家伙带走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.84,1:24:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.51,1:24:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的...山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.51,1:24:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.34,1:24:23.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要挡下那些熔岩
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.22,1:24:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.97,1:24:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.89,1:24:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.64,1:24:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.06,1:24:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.57,1:24:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的跳了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.57,1:24:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.23,1:24:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,温莉
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.40,1:24:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.07,1:24:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 手臂被毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.24,1:24:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的 你老爱乱来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.45,1:24:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.16,1:24:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才那是什么声音?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.62,1:24:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是从弹药库传出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.92,1:24:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.54,1:24:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把炸弹带走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.09,1:24:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保护米洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.13,1:25:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办? 齿轮坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.47,1:25:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有更换的零件吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.39,1:25:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只带了维修道具来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.31,1:25:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,温莉 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.98,1:25:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓紧了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.45,1:25:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也要下去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.45,1:25:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上校
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.28,1:25:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让小孩先走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.24,1:25:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让小孩先走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.04,1:25:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要往前推 慢慢走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.25,1:25:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 冈伯!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.96,1:25:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冈伯 我有事要拜托你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.59,1:25:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我把手弄坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.13,1:25:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混帐 熔岩就要流过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.59,1:25:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们也快去避难
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.30,1:25:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有这只手我就无法挡下熔岩
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.34,1:25:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托你 可以借我一些零件吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.01,1:25:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你就是...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.48,1:25:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要撑下去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.19,1:25:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.44,1:26:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.07,1:26:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来挡下熔岩
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.66,1:26:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.03,1:26:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你把鲜血之星...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.53,1:26:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在的我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.99,1:26:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该可以使出大地的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.75,1:26:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.55,1:26:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.80,1:26:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的星星
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.26,1:26:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚德拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.26,1:26:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.26,1:26:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你...你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.94,1:26:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,辛苦你炼成鲜血之星
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.32,1:26:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还记得我吗? 亚德拉斯护卫长
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.86,1:26:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你是...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.24,1:26:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是被你撕下脸皮的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.95,1:26:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷·克莱顿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.95,1:26:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷...哥哥?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.04,1:26:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从未忘记过那天的事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.34,1:27:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我被你撕下脸与侧腹的皮肤后
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.09,1:27:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,使用父母为了研究用而偷藏的鲜血之星存活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.18,1:27:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你居然杀了我父母 亚德拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.94,1:27:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶 都到了这里...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.15,1:27:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就下黄泉向我父母赔罪吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.71,1:27:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.37,1:27:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的是雅修雷哥哥吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.00,1:27:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.96,1:27:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你是我哥哥 请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.13,1:27:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为何至今
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.34,1:27:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都没来告诉我你还活着?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.51,1:27:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.89,1:27:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是为了揪出杀死父母的那男子
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.56,1:27:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有派狼人合成兽保护你至今
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.06,1:28:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,派来保护我?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.90,1:28:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 跟我回古雷达吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.82,1:28:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达不是我的故乡
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.78,1:28:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,养育我长大的地方是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.99,1:28:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你忘了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.74,1:28:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个山谷的人们把爸妈当成叛徒
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.91,1:28:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种山谷是不会有未来的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.71,1:28:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然有 我们会开创的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.75,1:28:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会开创给你看的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.29,1:28:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白费力气
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.55,1:28:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会埋掉这座山谷 再派军队来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.80,1:28:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,埋掉? 你在说什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.18,1:28:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了得到圣地
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.35,1:28:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.64,1:28:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就用我们兄妹的手
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.06,1:28:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来持续制造出鲜血之星吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.39,1:28:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那件事没得商量
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.98,1:28:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 上校
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.65,1:28:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.90,1:28:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连亚美斯多利斯的将校都来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.03,1:28:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很遗憾的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.15,1:28:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯的遗迹被毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.32,1:28:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那还真是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.49,1:28:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星星的炼成阵存在我的脑里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.50,1:29:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要重建就好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.66,1:29:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为何要对星星如此执着?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.96,1:29:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底想做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.00,1:29:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要用星星开启真理之门
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.84,1:29:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.01,1:29:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得到从没人看过的全新世界
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.43,1:29:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣地跟星星都只是手段罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.85,1:29:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真理才是唯一值得取得的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.89,1:29:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 跟我一起...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.98,1:29:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.86,1:29:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真以为自己变成神了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.61,1:29:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吞下星星 连你的心都被侵蚀了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.74,1:29:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快找回原来的自己
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.82,1:29:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,触犯禁忌的人居然还有脸这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.20,1:29:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,墙快撑不下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.54,1:29:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会让你埋掉山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.66,1:29:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.96,1:29:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要挡下熔岩
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.21,1:29:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,休想这么做!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.67,1:29:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这混帐 是想杀了妹妹吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.89,1:29:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.68,1:29:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.64,1:29:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,熔岩...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.51,1:30:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,熔岩流到河边了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.27,1:30:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就要流过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.73,1:30:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.85,1:30:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.74,1:30:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你 快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.58,1:30:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少来碍事
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.63,1:30:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.00,1:30:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为何你要对让我们受苦的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.29,1:30:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个愚蠢丑陋的世界如此坚持
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.26,1:30:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 跟我一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.43,1:30:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不走
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.43,1:30:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算是垃圾山
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.01,1:30:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里也不是丑陋的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.77,1:30:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.64,1:30:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看起来更愚蠢 更丑陋
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.69,1:30:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要阻挠我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.28,1:30:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是星星的力量吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.69,1:30:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我本来以为只有你会了解
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.03,1:31:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来你跟那些垃圾是一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.67,1:31:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.42,1:31:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.96,1:31:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.80,1:31:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手 雅修雷
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.89,1:31:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.72,1:31:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.81,1:31:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.19,1:31:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你还是不懂哥哥的想法
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.48,1:31:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就跟山谷一起埋没吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.86,1:31:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞不懂的是你才对吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.82,1:31:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是爱乱窜
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.78,1:31:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的是茱莉亚的哥哥吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.99,1:31:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.95,1:31:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,堵住熔岩的出□
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.74,1:31:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不快点的话 山谷会...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.49,1:31:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.87,1:31:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.81,1:32:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,牺性人命换来真理
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.94,1:32:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底哪里有趣了?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.03,1:32:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.69,1:32:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的国家至今又为何而战?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.86,1:32:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重复愚劣的杀戮 将之视为正义
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.53,1:32:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种人世根本没有留下的价值
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.20,1:32:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要得到真理 将其一扫而空
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.91,1:32:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你只是想逃避现在的现实而已吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.67,1:32:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说什么新世界的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.67,1:32:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真理不是用来摧毁现实的道具!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.34,1:32:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讲得一副你好像很懂
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.14,1:32:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.73,1:32:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.74,1:33:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果真有新世界
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.20,1:33:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那并不存在于真理之门的另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.16,1:33:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是就在你的脚边
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.58,1:33:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混帐
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.25,1:33:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能了解被迫背上莫名的不幸
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.59,1:33:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是有多么痛苦吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.19,1:33:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法到上面
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.90,1:33:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.74,1:33:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由我来把世界...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.53,1:33:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重新改造
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.46,1:34:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快住手!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.68,1:34:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你不了解爸妈为何要坚守圣地的秘密吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.64,1:34:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们想保护的不是圣地
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.89,1:34:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是米洛斯的人们
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.10,1:34:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.81,1:34:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚她...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.65,1:34:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样下去两边都会死
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.24,1:34:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太强了 得想办法...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.62,1:34:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.87,1:34:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.55,1:34:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.29,1:35:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.87,1:35:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.66,1:35:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 趁现在!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.63,1:35:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把熔岩...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.00,1:35:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果从下面没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.17,1:35:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就从对面伸出手
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.34,1:35:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对面?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.05,1:35:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.09,1:35:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.39,1:35:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.87,1:35:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.25,1:35:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.12,1:36:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.92,1:36:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈 好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.46,1:36:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没事了  - 熔岩停下来了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.76,1:36:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.26,1:36:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停下来了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.07,1:36:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥 我不会让你死的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.11,1:36:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.78,1:36:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 茱莉亚  - 喂 快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.87,1:36:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.12,1:36:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.29,1:36:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.62,1:36:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要救哥哥...哥哥...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.00,1:36:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,熔岩停止流动了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.92,1:36:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生暴动
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.96,1:36:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯那些人潜入基地里了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.30,1:36:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.18,1:36:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌人正在动摇
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.43,1:36:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟上去!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.89,1:36:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中央闸门被突破了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.73,1:36:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈薛中校呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.06,1:37:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有回应
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.10,1:37:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夺回圣地又得重来了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.11,1:37:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全军 暂时撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.57,1:37:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.99,1:37:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.70,1:37:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.68,1:37:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.89,1:37:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.93,1:37:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.49,1:37:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得让伤□愈合才行
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.99,1:38:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样做会有点粗暴 忍耐点
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.96,1:38:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 快睁开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.21,1:38:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己不是说过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.38,1:38:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米洛斯人要靠自己从山谷爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.26,1:38:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.13,1:38:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 血止住了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.72,1:38:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爱德! 阿尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.64,1:38:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,温莉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.85,1:38:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.06,1:38:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幸好有这只手臂
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.85,1:38:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得去谢谢冈伯才行
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.61,1:38:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来剩下交给他们处理比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.21,1:38:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在此宣布米洛斯建国
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.17,1:38:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天正是我们全新的诞生之日
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.16,1:40:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.87,1:40:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你醒来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.29,1:40:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴塔涅
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.34,1:40:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古雷达军已经撤退了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.84,1:40:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是他们应该很快就会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.30,1:41:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚美斯多利斯也开始在调派部队
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.56,1:41:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米兰达的事我听说了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.68,1:41:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是抱歉 茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.89,1:41:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多亏有你一个人撑住
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.52,1:41:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅修雷已经走了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.11,1:41:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.61,1:41:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个耳环是盔甲兄交给我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.49,1:41:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.45,1:41:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说这是茱莉亚重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.71,1:41:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.08,1:41:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该还有一个才对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.92,1:41:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这本来就只有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.80,1:41:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的就是这一个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.22,1:41:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴塔涅
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.68,1:41:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有很多事得去做
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.60,1:41:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来才是真正的挑战
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.27,1:41:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.45,1:42:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的做出超夸张的东西来了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.91,1:42:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幸好山谷平安无事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.79,1:42:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望茱莉亚他们的愿望能实现呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.50,1:42:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,照他们的个性
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.58,1:42:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该会拼到实现为止吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.64,1:42:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.10,1:42:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样不行啦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.39,1:42:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,脚那样还跑出来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.73,1:42:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想好好谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.81,1:42:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴看到你这么有精神
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.69,1:42:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 爱德
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.98,1:42:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果没有你们
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.49,1:42:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就救不了这个山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.40,1:42:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.07,1:42:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.82,1:42:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我绝对不会认同你做过的事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.83,1:42:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.54,1:42:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们接下来也会用
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.00,1:42:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们认为是正确的方式前进
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.13,1:43:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开辟出只有我们找得到的道路
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.05,1:43:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后 总有一天我们会来告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.18,1:43:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过啊...该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.51,1:43:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.01,1:43:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.18,1:43:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.02,1:43:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.06,1:43:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿尔 我先走罗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.86,1:43:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.78,1:43:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是个好哥哥呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.78,1:43:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们真是对好兄弟呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.95,1:43:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚 你变得不一样了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.92,1:43:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.00,1:43:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还不太习惯
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.46,1:43:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是 我不是说那个
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.42,1:43:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.13,1:43:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说你变漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.39,1:43:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.14,1:43:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我似乎已经懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.85,1:44:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不论是山谷还是大家
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.56,1:44:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直认为要得到力量
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.90,1:44:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己要保护大家才行
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.15,1:44:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果只是仰赖爸妈留下来的意念以及圣地的力量罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.54,1:44:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,失去许多之后 我才终于察觉
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.87,1:44:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使如此
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.12,1:44:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想守护的东西 确实就在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.17,1:44:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我不会后悔自己做过的事
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.92,1:44:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要用这只脚站起来
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.42,1:44:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.26,1:44:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来茱莉亚已经找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.43,1:44:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.27,1:44:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.48,1:44:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也一定会找回我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.02,1:44:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后 我会再来找你的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.94,1:44:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我等你来
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.96,1:45:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然派了这么多人来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.42,1:45:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上面已经准备开战了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.30,1:45:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对手是古雷达境内的恐怖份子
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.22,1:45:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,况且这次对于恐怖份子的处理
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.85,1:45:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我方也有不当之处
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.14,1:45:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无法轻易出手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.52,1:45:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 应该先观察古雷达动静?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.14,1:45:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也只能这样了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.81,1:45:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,话说回来 钢仔
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.90,1:45:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那并不是人体炼成对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.98,1:45:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙并没死
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.65,1:45:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,茱莉亚是让他从微弱的生命中重新复苏
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.62,1:45:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用鲜血之星...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.49,1:45:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及自己的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.87,1:45:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.50,1:45:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,失去的生命是要不回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.50,1:45:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,透过这个真理
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.59,1:45:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我们知道存活的意义与价值
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.68,1:45:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们看
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.10,1:45:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经看不见山谷了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.66,1:46:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 还没还没从梦中醒来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.04,1:46:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 这条路的另一端究竟有什么? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.72,1:46:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 一定一定会有答案 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.18,1:46:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 还是无法放弃无法停下来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.81,1:46:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 但是发尾飘逸只要一下就好 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.73,1:47:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 想要待在你那温柔的笑容旁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.29,1:47:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 笔直奔跑晴朗的蓝天夺目耀眼 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.84,1:47:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 在顺风吹拂下开始新的旅途 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.47,1:47:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 为了总有一天再次相见 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.18,1:47:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 不要回头朝明日迈进 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.06,1:47:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ GOOD LUCK MY WAY ∮
