Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.32,1:47:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 似乎就找不到答案 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.33,1:47:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 一定一定不会后悔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.83,1:47:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 为了能彼此欢笑继续前进 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.55,1:47:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,∮ 已经不必害怕 ∮
